  "steps": [
    "To a blender add: a handful of coriander, a handful of mint, 1 inch ginger (10g), 6 cloves garlic, 1 green chilli, 3 cloves, 1 small cinnamon stick, 4 cardamom pods, 2 tsp cumin seeds, 2 tsp fennel seeds, 150ml water.",
    "Blend everything into a nice smooth green paste and set it aside.",
    "Now to a pan on medium heat add: 2 tbsp oil, 1 chopped onion (90g), 100g soya chunks (raw weight, soaked).",
    "Sauté until the onions turn a nice golden/dark brown. It took me about 10 minutes.",
    "Now add the prepared green paste and cook until the raw smell goes away.",
    "Add: 1 tsp garam masala, 1 tsp salt.",
    "Mix well.",
    "Now add: 500ml water, 250g washed basmati rice.",
    "Give everything a good mix and bring it to a boil.",
    "Once the water is consistently boiling, add a handful of coriander.",
    "Cover and bring the flame to low.",
    "25 minutes later, it’s all ready to serve."
  ],
